==English==

===Etymology===
from {{etyl|LL.|en}} {{term|monetarius||lang=la|pertaining to money}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|monetarius||lang=la|of a mint}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|moneta||lang=la|mint", "coinage}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Of, pertaining to, or consisting of [[money]].

